					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I liked this story: the display of the very horror and cruelty perpetrated by humans, and the gradual buildup as 'mundane' human horror eventually builds up into something truly supernatural and cosmic: the mundane and the cosmic, a horror all too real and a horror beyond anything that could be real.</p> <p>Also: someone inform the Church of the Broken God, I think we found the <a href="http://http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-882">True Heart</a>.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
