					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="margin-block-start:0px; margin-block-end:0px;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RI4LTfFBWzw">Heart rate down to a crawl</a></span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="margin-block-start:0px; margin-block-end:0px;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RI4LTfFBWzw">Tick, tick, tick, tick</a></span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="margin-block-start:0px; margin-block-end:0px;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RI4LTfFBWzw">Empty but for one thought</a></span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="margin-block-start:0px; margin-block-end:0px;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RI4LTfFBWzw">Tick, tick, tick, tick</a></span></p> </blockquote> <p><span style="margin-block-start:0px; margin-block-end:0px;">Part of a larger headcanon that may or may not get fleshed out further down the road. I had wanted to debut this on r/nosleep before posting here, but unfortunately it was rejected due to a lack of &quot;well defined horror elements&quot;. C'est la vie.</span></p> <p><span style="margin-block-start:0px; margin-block-end:0px;">Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mew-ltiverse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5271378&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1580852327" alt="Mew-ltiverse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5271378)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mew-ltiverse" >Mew-ltiverse</a></span> for crit on the final draft.</span></p> <p>Images: <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/14578185598/">1</a>, <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Edward_VII_Memorial_Clock_Tower,_West_Parade,_Bexhill_(inside)_(2).jpg">2</a><br /></p> 
